# LF everywhere, stored AND checked out, whatever core.autocrlf happens to be set to on a contributor's machine.
# Patterns below win over this one - gitattributes is last-match-wins - so the binaries keep their own rule.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never line-ending-translate a binary. The repo ships its mod DLLs and textures ready to install, and a
# translated .dll or .dds is simply corrupt.
*.png  binary
*.dds  binary
*.zstd binary
*.dll  binary
*.so   binary
*.pdb  binary
*.exe  binary
*.zip  binary

# Kept for parity with the server repo, so a shell script added here is safe from core.autocrlf.
*.sh text eol=lf
